OpenSwathWorkflow -- Complete workflow to run OpenSWATH
Full documentation: http://www.openms.de/doxygen/release/4.0.0/html/TOPP_OpenSwathWorkflow.html
Version: 1.0.0 (OpenMS core 4.0.0, revision 4fdec46)
